OL,3,GNEWSAPeople 'living in fear' after cars
OL,4,Aattacked
OL,5,
OL,6,FA DUP councillor has said people are
OL,7,Fliving in fear after a spate of attacks
OL,8,Fon cars in the Waterside area of
OL,9,FLondonderry on Sunday night.
OL,11,FAt least three cars had their windows
OL,12,Fsmashed in the Irish Street and Top of
OL,13,FHill areas.
OL,15,FThe police said the attacks on two cars
OL,16,Fin Irish Street were carried out by
OL,17,Fyoung people armed with sticks and some
OL,18,Fof whom were masked.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
