OL,3,GNEWSAPeople 'living in fear' after cars
OL,4,Aattacked
OL,5,
OL,6,FDUP councillor Niree McMorris said:
OL,7,F"Night after night, we are seeing
OL,8,Fyouths coming into the area and
OL,9,Fattacking property."
